s-might-be-making-your-drive-home-safer-when-the-predators-are-around-deer-tend-to-avoid-roads-preventing-some-collisions-180989314/</link><description>一项新的研究表明，在华盛顿的奥林匹克半岛，野猫的出现使得鹿与车辆相撞的可能性在五年内下降了 67%，并且残骸数量总体下降了 76%</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/pumas-might-be-making-your-drive-home-safer-when-the-predators-are-around-deer-tend-to-avoid-roads-preventing-some-collisions-180989314/</guid></item><item><title>英国考古学家在准备道路建设时出土了一把罗马时代的指甲清洁器，其手柄形状像阴茎</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-England-preparing-for-road-construction-unearthed-a-roman-era-fingernail-cleaner-with-a-handle-shaped-like-a-penis-180989318/</link><description>罗马人认为阳具是好运的象征，并用它来装饰物品、标记墙壁和激发雕塑灵感</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 22:45:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-England-preparing-for-road-construction-unearthed-a-roman-era-fingernail-cleaner-with-a-handle-shaped-like-a-penis-180989318/</guid></item><item><title>西班牙将迎来日全食。马德里博物馆正在用数字艺术品来庆祝“在日食之光”下照亮其画作</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-total-solar-eclipse-is-coming-to-spain-this-madrid-museum-is-celebrating-with-a-digital-artwork-illuminating-its-paintings-in-the-light-of-the-eclipse-180989311/</link><description>普拉多的一部新动画名为“El Prado a la luz del eclipse”，使用人工智能来想象戈雅和委拉斯开兹的杰作，就好像他们的场景发生在日全食期间一样</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 21:08:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-total-solar-eclipse-is-coming-to-spain-this-madrid-museum-is-celebrating-with-a-digital-artwork-illuminating-its-paintings-in-the-light-of-the-eclipse-180989311/</guid></item><item><title>如何在直播中观看日全食，从自己的家中见证罕见的日冕景象</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/how-to-watch-the-total-solar-eclipse-on-a-live-stream-witnessing-the-rare-view-of-the-suns-corona-from-your-own-home-180989315/</link><des